s.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">UNI_BOOK_LOW_SerialKiller_Highberrys_CoastWayRoutes</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:UNI_BOOK_LOW_SerialKiller_Highberrys_CoastWayRoutes\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:UNI_BOOK_LOW_SerialKiller_Highberrys_CoastWayRoutes\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">b9170400-152f-4e12-a673-316b1fba10e2</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:b9170400-152f-4e12-a673-316b1fba10e2\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:b9170400-152f-4e12-a673-316b1fba10e2\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>In the basement of <a href=\"/wiki/Highberry%27s_Home\" title=\"Highberry's Home\">Highberrys' Home</a> at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-591&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;764</span></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>[A book advising merchants on trade routes by one Roger Highberry.]\n</p><p><br>\nNow, you'd be forgiven for thinking \"I've made it on the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Coast_Way\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/33px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/44px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Coast Way\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-extlink\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Coast_Way\">Coast Way</a></span> - it's plain sailing to <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Baldur%27s_Gate\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/33px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/44px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Baldur's Gate\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-extlink\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Baldur%27s_Gate\">Baldur's Gate</a></span> from here.\" That's where you'd be wrong, my friend. While it only spans from <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Beregost\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/33px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/44px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Bereghost\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-extlink\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Beregost\">Bereghost</a></span> to the great Gate itself, the Coast Way is more tricksy than you'd expect - and it's a prime spot for ne'er-do-wells and ruffian types to prey on understanding mercantile folk on account of the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Cloak_Wood\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/33px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/44px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Cloak Wood's\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-extlink\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Cloak_Wood\">Cloak Wood's</a></span> proximity.\n</p><p><br>\n[The rest of the writing continues in a similarly ambling, but ultimately helpful manner.]\n</p>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>See also:\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Merchant%27s_Almanac:_The_Trade_Way\" title=\"Merchant's Almanac: The Trade Way\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Book_Tome_X_Item_Icon.png/30px-Book_Tome_X_Item_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fe/Book_Tome_X_Item_Icon.png/45px-Book_Tome_X_Item_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/fe/Book_Tome_X_Item_Icon.png/60px-Book_Tome_X_Item_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Book_Tome_X_Item_Icon.png/30px-Book_Tome_X_Item_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fe/Book_Tome_X_Item_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Merchant%27s_Almanac:_The_Trade_Way\" title=\"Merchant's Almanac: The Trade Way\">Merchant's Almanac: The Trade Way</a></span></li></ul></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714214337\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.072 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.078 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2937/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 54175/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 18690/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 29/200\nExpen